  "bio": "Jesse Neese stands as a paragon of professionalism in the tattoo industry, with an impressive tenure of creating all-custom tattoos since 1999. Specializing in Japanese, realism, and black & gray styles, Jesse operates out of Omaha, NE, where clients can expect a seamless and professional experience at their studio. With every detailed piece, Jesse's commitment to excellence is clearly inked into the skin of satisfied customers.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Omaha, Nebraska, United States",
